  "About": {
    "title": "Diamond Industrial Tools Est.",
    "p1": "Diamond Tools & Equipment Est (DIT.) has been in the trading business since 1997 playing a vital role by supplying and maintaining quality equipment to different large construction sites and factories around the kingdom.",
    "p2": "Through the years, DIT has established long-standing relationships with international partners such as Tyrolit (Austria), Mirka (Finland), Sundisc (Netherlands), Garryson (UK), Saint-Gobain (India), and Starcke (Germany). This has strengthened its position as one of the leading authorized distributors in the Kingdom for construction and industrial sectors.",
    "p3": "DIT strives to meet customer expectations by maintaining a wide range of tools and machines in stock, offering top-quality products recognized worldwide. Our specialized technical team in Jeddah provides after-sales services, engineering solutions, consultations, and original spare parts with professional maintenance at reasonable prices."
